Derivation
----------

This work is derived from the Uniswap V4 Subgraph
(https://github.com/Uniswap/v4-subgraph), which is licensed under the GNU
General Public License version 3. That licence is why this repository is
GPL-3.0 and not a permissive licence.

What was taken: the pricing and core entity logic. In particular
`src/utils/pricing.ts` is a TypeScript port of the subgraph's own
`pricing.ts`, retaining its function names (`sqrtPriceX96ToTokenPrices`,
`getTrackedAmountUSD`, `safeDiv`, `exponentToBigDecimal`), its `Q192`
constant and its native-token and stablecoin-pool handling. Entity shapes in
`schema.graphql` follow the subgraph's where they describe the same concepts.

What changed, relative to that subgraph:

  - Rewritten to run on Envio HyperIndex rather than The Graph, so handlers,
    the entity API and the configuration format are different throughout.
  - Multichain from one deployment, rather than one deployment per chain.
  - PoolManager, Tick, the ModifyLiquidity entity and PositionManager dropped.
  - `Swap.priceUSD0` / `priceUSD1` and `blockNumber` added.
  - `TokenCandle` (1m, 5m, 1h, 1d) and `PoolCandle` (1h, 1d) added; the
    subgraph has no historical price series.
  - `asOf` stamps and a `dex` field added.

The Envio HyperIndex runtime this indexer runs on is a separate work with its
own licensing, and is not covered by this licence.
